LocalScribe FFmpeg notice
========================

LocalScribe includes FFmpeg 8.1.2 as a separate command-line sidecar. The app
invokes it as an independent process to decode local media into PCM WAV audio.

This FFmpeg executable is built from the unmodified official source archive
without GPL, nonfree, version-3-only, network, or optional external-library
components. The resulting FFmpeg build reports "LGPL version 2.1 or later".

The applicable LGPL v2.1 license text is included as `ffmpeg.LICENSE`. Source
provenance, checksum, and the configure options are in `ffmpeg.BUILD.txt`.
The exact FFmpeg source archive is published beside every LocalScribe binary
release and is also available from:

https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.2.tar.xz

The reproducible build script is part of the LocalScribe source repository:

scripts/build-ffmpeg-lgpl.sh

FFmpeg project: https://ffmpeg.org/
